    title: "Core non-linker modules carry private JS/TS extension lists missing .mjs/.cjs/.jsx/.mts/.cts (cli staleness check, cli _EXT_TO_LANG, supply_chain, repo_fingerprint, sketch) -- residual of WI-fovus/WI-hizon"  # b53f
